# Rust build output.
#
# Unlike the cartridge and the plugins, NOTHING BUILT HERE IS COMMITTED: axon is a service, so the
# binary is produced by whatever builds the image and the ONNX Runtime libraries `ort` downloads
# are large and platform-specific.
#
# What IS committed is `tests/fixtures/` -- the two ONNX models and the worst-case Ants
# observation. They are small, they are the only reason the tests can measure anything real, and
# `tests/fixtures/make-model.py` regenerates the models deterministically.
target/

# Local run artifacts
.run/
